 "text": "Locations - Cooperative Farmers Elevator\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions.\nFunctional\nFunctional\nAlways active\nRequired for the site to work. These cookies enable core functions like page navigation and secure areas, and the site can't run properly without them.\nPreferences\nPreferences\nRemember your choices, like language or region, so the site behaves the way you expect on return visits.\nStatistics\nStatistics\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes.\nHelp us understand how visitors use the site through anonymous, aggregated data. This information isn't used to identify you.\nMarketing\nMarketing\nUsed to track visitors across sites and build profiles for delivering relevant advertising.\nManage options\nManage services\nManage {vendor_count} vendors\nRead more about these purposes\nAccept\nDeny\nView preferences\nSave preferences\nView preferences\nOpt-out preferences\nPrivacy Policy\n{title}\nSkip to content\nCredit App\nDaily Grain Bid Texts\nDTN News\nCFE Connect\nSustainability\nSmart Order\nWomen In Ag\nLocations\nAbout\nNews\nCareers\nContact\nAgronomy\nView Plot Data\nSeed Partners\nAgronomy Locations\nContact Team\nFeed\nSmart Order\nLivestock Futures\nFeed Services\nFeed Partners\nFeed Locations\nContact Team\nGrain\nMake a Grain Offer\nAg Futures\nCash Bids\nGrain Policies\nContracts\nOptions\nGrain News\nWeather\nGrain Locations\nContact Team\nLumber\nApply for Lumber Credit\nLumber Services\nCustom Built Homes\nLumber Products\nKitchen & Bath Products\nCFE Lumber Portfolio\nLumber Locations\nContact Team\nAgronomy\nView Plot Data\nSeed Partners\nAgronomy Locations\nContact Team\nFeed\nSmart Order\